{"4708400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "You're Alive, Phil", "steam_appid": 4708400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4826590], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phil had a thought.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which was unusual, because rocks don't typically do a lot of thinking. But here he was. Thinking. He was doing quite a lot of it, in fact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're Alive, Phil, is an indie minimalist 3D puzzle game about coming to terms with your place in an indifferent universe. Help Phil navigate his sudden and unexpected existence through oodles of levels and distinct puzzle mechanics, all while listening to his story unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a minimalist aesthetic, an atmospheric soundtrack, and a casual-friendly control scheme, You're Alive, Phil allows players to stretch their minds without stressing their minds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No-Stress: No quick-time events or skill-based platforming, take your time to solve the puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work through 8 different puzzle mechanics across 80 levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story Phil, the unexpectedly sentient cube, narrated by the developer.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phil had a thought.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Which was unusual, because rocks don't typically do a lot of thinking. But here he was. Thinking. He was doing quite a lot of it, in fact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're Alive, Phil, is an indie minimalist 3D puzzle game about coming to terms with your place in an indifferent universe. Help Phil navigate his sudden and unexpected existence through oodles of levels and distinct puzzle mechanics, all while listening to his story unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a minimalist aesthetic, an atmospheric soundtrack, and a casual-friendly control scheme, You're Alive, Phil allows players to stretch their minds without stressing their minds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No-Stress: No quick-time events or skill-based platforming, take your time to solve the puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work through 8 different puzzle mechanics across 80 levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the story Phil, the unexpectedly sentient cube, narrated by the developer.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Help Phil work out what it means to be alive. Guide our rocky friend through 100 levels of relaxing, grid-based puzzle platforming, accompanied by atmospheric music and narration.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708400/d55b2356e1c0fcbaf9f8c5b5af830822e0e8bca5/header.jpg?t=1786895844", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708400/de686274516a4efe263bcdcb097351ef74cb86c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786895844", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4708400/de686274516a4efe263bcdcb097351ef74cb86c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786895844", "website": "http://b3agz.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 version 21H1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 version 21H1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<b